  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **My Sweet Blue Eyed Darling** (1 other source): The opening song includes a tease of the Wood Brothers' \"Honey Jar\" [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Cuckoo Bird**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Rock of Ages**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Pretty Polly**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Doin' Things Right, Ain't Nothing To Me (2), Dos Banjos [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2018-04-27.litz.sbd.neumannKM150.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 141 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2018-04-27.litz.sbd.neumannKM150.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Soundboard + Neumaann KM150's>Sound Devices 744t [1]. Also: Recorded with Neumann KM150 microphones aimed at the audience, twelve feet apart, blended with a soundboard feed; Chain: Sound Devices 744t at 16-bit/44.1 kHz, Nuendo 4 mix, Sound Forge Pro 11 fades, CD WAV tracking, Trader's Little Helper to FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by holdmyticket.com: [Billy Strings opening J.P. Biondo Plenty of tciekts at the @ River Street Jazz Cafe Plains, PA - April 27th 2018 9:00 pm](https://holdmyticket.com/event/307467) [3]\n- Fan art by holdmyticket.com: [Billy Strings opening J.P. Biondo Plenty of tciekts at the @ River Street Jazz Cafe Plains, PA - April 27th 2018 9:00 pm](https://holdmyticket.com/event/307467) [4]",
